51:/// Apply `ToolChoice::None` to the messages and tools, per model family.
52:///
53:/// - No tool round: nothing changes.
54:/// - `AnthropicNoneField`: the `toolConfig` holds the user tools and one
55:///   derived spec for each tool name in the history that is not yet listed.
